{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":143,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"60b5ca5c-c155-407a-95f6-7d75b8a41d80","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151263797,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电机电磁设计工程师（2027届）(J10938)","OrgId":3378308,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、协助主任工程师完成电机电磁方案设计，磁路计算，性能仿真优化(损耗，振动噪音，热分析等)。\n\n2、协助解决设计、测试、生产中相关问题，参与制定电机电磁设计规范，仿真sop,测试标准，性能分析等； \n\n3、负责竞品分析及研究，掌握市场的发展要求， 并进行持续性能优化;","Require":"1、精通电机电磁学原理，绕组理论，极槽配合选取原则。\n2.能够熟练使用motorcad JMAG,Maxwell等软件，进行电-磁-热有限元仿真分析。\n 3、熟悉各类电机包括永磁同步电机、无刷直流电机、轴向磁通等电磁设计及结构设计要点； \n4、熟悉电机各类国标测试要求，电气性能和耐久性设计标准和要求\n5、硕士及以上学历，电机与电器、电气工程及其自动化、自动化等相关专业（哈工大、华中科大、东南大学、浙大、沈工大、哈理工等优先）","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-15T17:52:32","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"6a09682a-e650-45df-a002-ed9132d5cc14","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151260601,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"C端产品销售管培生（2027届）(J10928)","OrgId":3378254,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、市场调研与分析：协助收集、整理市场信息，包括行业动态、竞品分析及用户需求洞察，输出数据报告，为市场策略提供参考依据。\n2、活动策划与执行：参与策划并执行各类市场推广活动，如线上线下宣传活动、展会、赛事赞助等，负责方案撰写、物料准备、流程跟进及现场执行。\n3、内容创作：制作品牌市场宣传资料，如海报文案、宣传推文、短视频脚本等，提升公司品牌形象。\n4、数据跟踪与复盘：跟踪市场推广活动及广告投放效果，进行基础数据统计与分析，定期撰写工作周报、月报，提出优化建议。\n5、跨部门协作：配合团队完成推广方案整理及效果跟踪，对接销售、产品等部门，推进营销方案落地。","Require":"1、学历背景：2027届本科及以上学历应届毕业生，市场营销、广告学、新闻传播、工商管理等相关专业优先。\n2、专业能力：\n（1）具备一定的市场营销理论知识，了解消费者心理学、广告学基础者优先；\n（2）具备基础文案撰写能力和活动策划能力；\n（3）熟练使用Office办公软件（Word、Excel、PowerPoint）；\n（4）会使用Canva、剪映等工具制作图文、短视频内容者优先。\n3、综合素质：\n（1）思维活跃，有创意想法，善于挖掘用户需求；\n（2）具备良好的沟通表达能力和团队协作精神；\n（3）对数据敏感，有一定的数据分析能力；\n（4）学习能力强，积极主动，能承担一定的工作压力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-08T15:50:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"a37774bc-c2b9-4882-b12c-c9fce5cb36d7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151260600,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"全球工业销售管培生（2027届）(J10929)","OrgId":897299,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"【全方位培训周期】\n1、销售管培生岗位属于公司重点资源投入校招岗位，该岗位在入职后会在技术、产品、方案、市场、运营等不同领域进行长周期进行培训、轮岗后最终走向销售岗位的赋能过程；\n\n\n【岗位描述】\n1、负责公司规定销售方向的客户进行开发与产品推广，并促成合作关系；\n2、负责完成所在区域内的业绩要求与销售过程指标要求;\n3、负责所在区域的客户资源管理与客户接待，进行日常客户的拜访和检查，及时处理客户投诉，提高客户满意度；\n4、负责不定期参加线下展会与行业交流机会，收集客户信息和行业信息并定期汇报；\n5、完成部门要求的各类报表与客户信息管理规范；\n6、完成领导交待的其它事务。\"","Require":"【岗位要求】\n1、本科及以上学历，自动化、机械、电子类等相关专业优先；\n2、具有销售实习经验与学校社团外联经验优先；\n3、有坚定的意志力，较强的执行力，对工作充满激情，敢于挑战；\n4、有良好的综合素质、沟通协调能力、抗压能力及情绪管理能力；\n5、具有良好销售职业规划和机器人行业热衷者优先；\n6、具备良好的销售潜质与销售意愿；\n7、愿意接受阶段性集团调度到全球各分子公司办公；\n8、具备英语六级、良好的英语沟通能力优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-08T15:50:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"35168389-f540-4fab-8bef-b84760e08ce5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151260599,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外工业销售管培生（2027届）(J10931)","OrgId":891365,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"2","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 参与海外工业市场销售培训计划，系统学习公司产品、行业应用、销售流程及海外业务运营模式。\n2. 协助海外销售团队开展客户开发与维护工作，包括潜在客户挖掘、需求收集、商务沟通及销售机会跟进。\n3. 支持客户拜访、产品演示、展会及市场推广活动，协助提升品牌影响力及市场覆盖率。\n4. 与应用工程师、产品、市场及供应链等跨部门团队协作，为客户提供解决方案并推动项目落地。\n5. 收集和分析行业动态、竞争对手信息及市场趋势，为区域销售策略制定提供支持。\n6. 参与销售项目全流程管理，包括报价、合同、订单执行、交付协调及回款跟进。\n* 该岗位培养结束后，须按业务需求派驻海外当地。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，机械、自动化、机器人等工科专业，或小语种专业；\n2. 英语听说读写流利，具备良好的跨文化沟通能力；\n3. 具有清晰的销售职业规划和较强的销售意愿，对工业自动化和机器人行业有浓厚兴趣；\n4. 具备良好的沟通表达能力和客户开发意识；\n5. 具备较强的目标感、主动性、执行力及抗压能力；\n6. 能接受海外派驻，适应海外工作环境及跨文化生活。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-08T15:50:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"28d694a1-237e-4842-b2fa-073c9911dfea","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151260598,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"全球教育销售管培生（2027届）(J10932)","OrgId":3378249,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId